OL,0,       GCEEFAX 1 119 Sat 28 NovC03:18/14
OL,1,W5j 5Q#7!wsj#%uzj#57kj  7kjc1uz   
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q % -,*,%%** %-.*,$-.*,%,. (,
OL,3,AWhy is there a shortage of 'wizard'    
OL,4,Aelevator mechanics?                    
OL,6,FSome of them are angry. Nerves are     
OL,7,Ffrayed. Many of them are just relieved 
OL,8,Fthat he's here.                        
OL,10,FWhen a lift stops working in Chicago,  
OL,11,Ffrazzled building managers might get a 
OL,12,Fvisit from Jim Lembesis. For more than 
OL,13,F47 years, Lembesis has repaired and    
OL,14,Fupgraded lifts. He says he understands 
OL,15,Fwhy staff and residents are so anxious 
OL,16,Fto have things working again.          
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/19
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,108,105,200,160,0,100
PN,11906
SC,0006
PS,C000
CT,25,T
OL,0,       GCEEFAX 1 119 Sat 28 NovC03:18/14
OL,1,W5j 5Q#7!wsj#%uzj#57kj  7kjc1uz   
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q % -,*,%%** %-.*,$-.*,%,. (,
OL,3,AWhy is there a shortage of 'wizard'    
OL,4,Aelevator mechanics?                    
OL,6,F"They wait and they wait," says        
OL,7,FLembesis, a field technician for       
OL,8,FParkway Elevators. "There's a lot of   
OL,9,Ffrustration. Sometimes it's a repeat   
OL,10,Fissue. It's a never-ending cycle, you  
OL,11,Fknow what I mean?"                     
OL,13,FThe widely reported shortage of lift   
OL,14,Fand escalator mechanics in the US,     
OL,15,Fwhich is also a problem in many other  
OL,16,Fcountries, has got worse over time, he 
OL,17,Fadds: "It's been like night and day    
OL,18,Fcompared to when I started."           
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/19
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,108,105,200,160,0,100
PN,11907
SC,0007
PS,C000
CT,25,T
OL,0,       GCEEFAX 1 119 Sat 28 NovC03:18/14
OL,1,W5j 5Q#7!wsj#%uzj#57kj  7kjc1uz   
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q % -,*,%%** %-.*,$-.*,%,. (,
OL,3,AAsia made a big AI bet on Nvidia. What 
OL,4,Ahappens now?                           
OL,6,FJensen Huang's extraordinary return as 
OL,7,FNvidia's boss rocked not only its      
OL,8,Fshares in New York but also sent       
OL,9,Fshockwaves through the artificial      
OL,10,Fintelligence (AI) industry around the  
OL,11,Fworld.                                 
OL,13,FThose jolts were felt particularly in  
OL,14,FAsia as the saga highlighted the       
OL,15,Fregion's huge exposure to the          
OL,16,Ftechnology.                            
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/19
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,109,105,200,160,0,100
PN,11908
SC,0008
PS,C000
CT,25,T
OL,0,       GCEEFAX 1 119 Sat 28 NovC03:18/14
OL,1,W5j 5Q#7!wsj#%uzj#57kj  7kjc1uz   
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q % -,*,%%** %-.*,$-.*,%,. (,
OL,3,AAsia made a big AI bet on Nvidia. What 
OL,4,Ahappens now?                           
OL,6,FTech-heavy stock indexes in Japan,     
OL,7,FSouth Korea and Taiwan went on a       
OL,8,Frollercoaster ride this week. Markets  
OL,9,Fsoared after a near-trillion dollar    
OL,10,Fsurge in Nvidia's share price but then 
OL,11,Fslumped as concerns about political and
OL,12,Fregulatory scrutiny hit investor       
OL,13,Fconfidence.                            
OL,15,FThe chipmaker is a "symbolic           
OL,16,Fbellwether" of the AI trade that is    
OL,17,Ffast becoming key to places like South 
OL,18,FKorea, Taiwan, Singapore and Malaysia,"
OL,19,Fsays Dylan Loh, an international       
OL,20,Fstudies lecturer at Nanyang            
OL,21,FTechnological University.              
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/19
