OL,0,       GCEEFAX 1 119 Sat 28 NovC03:18/14
OL,1,W5j 5Q7+j 55"k#j 5w;js1           
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ADec Donnelly says I'm a Celebrity      
OL,4,Atension 'became much bigger deal than  
OL,5,Ait should have'                        
OL,7,FI'm a Celebrity... Get Me Out of Here  
OL,8,Fhost Declan Donnelly has said tensions 
OL,9,Fbetween Mariella Frostrup and AJ Odudu 
OL,10,Fover cooking duties on the show "became
OL,11,Fa much bigger deal than it should      
OL,12,Fhave".                                 
OL,14,FCo-host Ant McPartlin said "cooking    
OL,15,Fmakes things very tense in camp",      
OL,16,Fadding: "If they could zoom out a      
OL,17,Flittle bit in there, they'll realise   
OL,18,Fit's not that deep. But they just      
OL,19,Fcan't, once they're in there".         
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/19
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,163,160,200,105,0,100
PN,11913
SC,0013
PS,C000
CT,25,T
OL,0,       GCEEFAX 1 119 Sat 28 NovC03:18/14
OL,1,W5j 5Q7+j 55"k#j 5w;js1           
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ADec Donnelly says I'm a Celebrity      
OL,4,Atension 'became much bigger deal than  
OL,5,Ait should have'                        
OL,7,FDonnelly and McPartlin discussed on    
OL,8,Ftheir podcast how relations became     
OL,9,Ffractious, when Odudu attempted to help
OL,10,FFrostrup cook on Saturday's episode -  
OL,11,Fthe next day Odudu was distressed after
OL,12,FFrostrup accused her of being          
OL,13,F"aggressive".                          
OL,15,FOn Wednesday 887 people complained to  
OL,16,FOfcom about Sunday's episode in        
OL,17,Frelation to "alleged bullying          
OL,18,Fbehaviour" by Frostrup towards Odudu.  
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/19
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
